title: DEBUG
new-page: true

= Britain | Britannien

- @dipmen: Go to Diplomatic Menu
- @return_western_menu: Return to Menu
- @return

@dipmen

Naval Treaty Progress: [+ british_naval_treaty_prog +]% 

Our relation with Britain: [? if british_relation = 0 : Hostile <progress id="file" value="0" max="10"> 0% </progress> Very Friendly ?][? if british_relation > 0 and british_relation <= 1 : <progress id="file" value="1" max="10"> 10% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 1 and british_relation <= 2 : <progress id="file" value="2" max="10"> 20% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 2 and british_relation <= 3 : <progress id="file" value="3" max="10"> 30% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 4 and british_relation <= 5 : <progress id="file" value="4" max="10"> 40% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 5 and british_relation <= 6 : <progress id="file" value="5" max="10"> 50% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 6 and british_relation <= 7 : <progress id="file" value="6" max="10"> 60% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 7 and british_relation <= 8 : <progress id="file" value="8" max="10"> 70% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 8 and british_relation <= 9 : <progress id="file" value="9" max="10"> 90% </progress>?][? if british_relation > 9 : <progress id="file" value="10" max="10"> 100% </progress>?] </br>

British Government: [+ britain_gov +] 

- @return_western_menu: Return to Menu
- @1state_visit: Organise a state visit to Britain
- @2reparations: Focus resources towards reparations negotiations
- @3sister_party: Support ideologically close parties in Britain
- @naval_treaty: Negotiate down the Naval Treaty that Britain has imposed upon us

@1state_visit
choose-if: british_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ british_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: british_actions_timer = 1.5; british_relation += 1.25; diplo_lev += 1; labour_sv_factor += 0.01 if labour_in_br_gov; british_naval_treaty_prog += 0.05; british_economic_union_prog += 0.01

We have organised a state visit to Britain and improved relations with their Government. This is easier to do with Britain, as we do not have as many grievances with them as we do the French.

@2reparations
choose-if: british_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ british_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: british_actions_timer = 1.5; reparations_negotiation += 1.25 if bri_fm_reparations_action != 1; bri_fm_reparations_action = 1; br_germany_love += 0.01 if labour_in_br_gov

We have focused resources towards reparations negotiations regarding the British Government, however they only have so much influence with the French - Doing this again will have drastically fewer benefits.

@3sister_party
choose-if: british_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ british_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: british_actions_timer = 1.5; british_relation += 1 if labour_in_br_gov; labour_sp_factor += 0.01; natlab_sp_factor += 0.01; libdem_sp_factor += 0.01; british_economic_union_prog += 0.1; british_naval_treaty_prog += 0.05

We have focused resources on building our bonds with the Labour party, as well as exploring co-operation with the Liberals[? if year >= 1930 : and the National Labour party ?].

@naval_treaty
choose-if: british_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ british_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: british_actions_timer = 1.5; british_naval_treaty_prog += 0.15; british_economic_union_prog += 0.01

We have focused resources towards reducing the terms of the british naval treaty

@return_western_menu
go-to: western_menu
